<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38352" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπασκ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>labour</i> or <i>toil at, prepare</i> or <i>finish
				carefully,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπήσκηται δέ οἱ αὐλὴ τοίχῳ καὶ
					θριγκοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.266
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>adorn, exalt,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ τιμαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					9.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				194.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ μήδεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Parth.</u>
					2.71
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>practise, cultivate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνην, τὰ ἐς πόλεμον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.166
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεντάεθλον, μουνομαχίην,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.92
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄλλα κατὰ ταὐτὰ Σκύθῃσι ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.82
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἐμπύρων τέχνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
					34(60).59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					517
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παγκράτιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.179
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνήμην ἐ.</span>
			<i>cultivate</i> memory, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.77
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμίν τινος ἐ.</span>
			<i>increase</i> his strength, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.136
			</span></i>: abs., <i>to be in training as an athlete,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Achae.
				3
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα Ῥωμαίοις ἐκ παλαιοῦ ἐπήσκηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.8.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>set on</i> one <i>against</i> another, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ τοὺς ἐχθρούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					46.40
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>train for</i> the contest, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀέθλοισιν . . ἐφήβους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.121.4
				</span></i>
			: also c. inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς τάξει χρῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					16.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
